<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!--
      L4 / DL-G5 / AC-G5: the canary soak, 168 cycles beside the armed loop.
      `run_shadow.sh` existed since 2026-09-08 and nothing ever ran it, so the
      canary, M-G03 and DRILL-G4 had no sample at all; a script that is not
      scheduled is a script that has not run.  Operator ruling 2026-09-12:
      one machine only, so the credentials the canary needs (dry_run still
      builds the venue) are on this host and L4 no longer has a home problem.
      No lock contention with the armed loop: the account lock is taken only
      by runs that are neither dry_run nor paper.  No shared-file contention
      either: `trades_the_account` keeps universe.json and metrics_snapshot
      for the process actually trading.
      KeepAlive relaunches EVERY non-zero exit, and the loop exits 1 when even
      one of its 168 cycles failed, so KeepAlive alone never ended a soak: on
      2026-09-23 it silently began a second 168 in the same record, and a
      clean exit would still meet RunAtLoad at the next login.  What ends a
      soak is run_shadow.sh, which asks the record how many cycles the latest
      round still owes before every start and exits 0 when the answer is none
      (docs/RUNBOOK.md, "shadow soak").  No key below changed for that fix,
      so an installed copy needs no reload.
      The flags in run_shadow.sh are written without leading dashes in these
      comments on purpose: two dashes in a row end an XML comment.
      Install: cp to ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ and
      `launchctl load -w ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.beidou.shadow.plist`.
    -->
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.beidou.shadow</string>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/maguannan/beidou/deploy/run_shadow.sh</string>
    </array>
    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/maguannan/beidou</string>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <dict>
        <key>SuccessfulExit</key>
        <false/>
    </dict>
    <key>ThrottleInterval</key>
    <integer>60</integer>
    <key>ExitTimeOut</key>
    <integer>30</integer>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/maguannan/Library/Application Support/beidou/shadow.stdout.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/maguannan/Library/Application Support/beidou/shadow.stderr.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
